# Valid placements

- A road must adjoin an existing road, settlement or city of the same colour.
    - If in board edit mode or construction plan edit mode the user attempts to violate this rule, it is not placed, and a message appears in the middle of the screen for a 2 seconds saying "Road must be adjacent to a road, settlement or city of the same colour."
- A settlement or city may not be within 1 side-length (i.e. adjacent) of any other settlement or city, regardless of colour.
    - If in board edit mode or construction plan edit mode the user attempts to violate this rule, it is not placed, and a message appears in the middle of the screen for a 2 seconds saying "Cannot place adjacent to a settlement or a city."
